{
  "Comment": "CloudLab c240g5: the 8-node capacity. 8 nodes exist only after a scale-out, so it runs first, without load (copy-then-flip: the rescale returns with every raw vector moved), and the ladder measures the cluster it leaves.",
  "WorkDir": "/data-ssd/chenxu/work/wiki-c1024",
